   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Directions",
     "texto": [
      "**Drept înainte** means «straight ahead», **la stânga**, «to the left», and **la dreapta**, «to the right». Just as in English («to the left», «to the right»), the preposition **la** comes before these words."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Polite instructions",
     "texto": [
      "**Mergeți** and **virați** are polite forms (formal «you») for giving directions. **Apoi** means «then» and links the steps of a route."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
